An exclusion without an inclusion selects every other account in CLI text output.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight accounts --accounts '~foobar'

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:foobar
account Equity:Opening

2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Cash  1 SEK
  Assets:foobar  2 SEK
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

Assets:Cash
Equity:Opening

========== WARNINGS ==========
